  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="utos-description">Description of Service</h2>
    <p>
      The TornManager userscript runs on Torn.com via a userscript manager (such as Tampermonkey) or Torn PDA and
      lets you create chat rooms with other players and share images in them. This goes beyond the faction, company,
      and private chats Torn provides. Chat rooms are free for every TornManager account and do not require a
      subscription; a Torn API key with Public access level is sufficient to sign in. An optional subscription
      unlocks extra features such as the Ranked War tab.
    </p>
    <p>By installing and using the userscript, you agree to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Allow the userscript to display its interface on Torn.com pages in your browser</li>
      <li>Allow the userscript to communicate with tornmanager.com to send and receive chat messages and images</li>
      <li>Allow the userscript to store authentication data, encryption keys, and interface preferences in your browser's localStorage</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Private rooms are joined through invite links and are end-to-end encrypted: the invite link carries the
      room's encryption key, which stays in your browser and is never sent to my server. Anyone who has a room's
      invite link can both join the room and read its messages. Treat invite links as secret and only share
      them with people you want in the room. TornManager also hosts public rooms that anyone can join, where you
      appear under a permanent anonymous pseudonym instead of your Torn name; public rooms are not encrypted.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="utos-api-key">API Key &amp; Authentication</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Never share your Torn password with anyone, including me.</strong> The userscript only requires your
      API key for authentication. You are responsible for creating and managing your key, monitoring its usage
      through Torn.com ('key' &rarr; 'log' selection), and revoking or regenerating it if you suspect misuse.
      By signing in you explicitly authorize TornManager to verify your identity via the Torn API as documented
      in the Privacy Policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="utos-acceptable-use">Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p>
      You alone are responsible for everything you send through the chat feature, including any images you upload.
      You must not use chat rooms to:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>harass, threaten, defame, or abuse anyone;</li>
      <li>share content that is illegal under applicable law. This includes, without limitation, child sexual abuse material (CSAM), which will be removed, preserved, and reported to the relevant authorities;</li>
      <li>upload malware, run scams, or attempt to phish other users;</li>
      <li>violate Torn's rules or Terms of Service; or</li>
      <li>spam, flood, or otherwise disrupt the service.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="utos-moderation">Moderation, Suspension &amp; Bans</h2>
    <p>
      The host of a private room can <strong>suspend</strong> and un-suspend members of that room; a suspended
      member keeps their membership but can no longer read or send messages there.
    </p>
    <p>
      Separately from room-level moderation, <strong>I reserve the right to ban you if you abuse the userscript</strong>
      or break the Acceptable Use rules above. A ban can remove your access to the chat feature, or to TornManager
      entirely, at my sole discretion and without prior notice. I may also delete individual messages,
      images, or entire rooms. Where content is unlawful I may preserve it and report it, together with the
      information needed to identify the account responsible, to law enforcement.
    </p>
    <p>
      To keep the service healthy, message and image sending is rate limited, images are limited to PNG or JPG files
      up to a few megabytes each, rooms have a member cap, and each account can be in a limited number of rooms at a
      time.
    </p>
    <p>
      The userscript uses <code>GM.xmlHttpRequest</code> to communicate with tornmanager.com, which bypasses
      standard browser cross-origin restrictions. This is a standard capability of userscript managers and is
      required for the userscript to function. The userscript communicates only with tornmanager.com and torn.com;
      uploaded images are stored with Amazon Web Services (AWS S3, EU region) acting as a processor on my behalf.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="utos-subscription">Subscription Model</h2>
    <p>
      Chats are free. Certain extra features (such as the Ranked War tab) require an active subscription, obtained
      by sending Xanax to <%= link_to "Bram [2728237]", "https://www.torn.com/profiles.php?XID=2728237", target: "_blank" %>.
      Payments are processed automatically once a day. Subscription status is tied to your Torn ID; details and
      additional ways to obtain subscription time are described in the
      <a href="#tos-subscription">Platform Terms</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

